    <div class="container privacy-policy-container">
        <h1 class="privacy-title text-center mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>Lenmanya Adventures</strong>. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and share your personal information when you visit our website or use our services.</p>

        <h2>Compliance</h2>
        <p>We adhere to the provisions of the <strong>Kenya Data Protection Act No. 24 of 2019 (DPA)</strong>, the Kenya Association of Tour Operators (KATO) Code of Conduct, and the Tourism Regulatory Authority (TRA) Quality Assurance guidelines.</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Name</li>
            <li>Email Address</li>
            <li>Phone Number</li>
            <li>Address</li>
            <li>Payment Information (for bookings and transactions)</li>
            <li>Travel Preferences</li>
            <li>IP Address</li>
            <li>Cookies and Usage Data</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Your information is used for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>To provide and maintain our services</li>
            <li>To process bookings and transactions</li>
            <li>To communicate with you and respond to inquiries</li>
            <li>To personalize your experience and offer tailored recommendations</li>
            <li>To improve our website and services</li>
            <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
        <p>We may share your information with:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Service providers and partners (e.g., hotels, airlines, tour operators)</li>
            <li>Regulatory authorities when required by law</li>
            <li>With your explicit consent</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We <strong>do not sell or rent</strong> personal information for marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement strict security measures to protect your data from unauthorized access, but please note that no method of internet transmission is 100% secure.</p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Access and update your personal information</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
            <li>Object to processing</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies to enhance user experience. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, though some features may not function as intended.</p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns, please reach out to us:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:bookings@lenmanyaadventures.com">bookings@lenmanyaadventures.com</a></li>
            <li>Phone: +254 794 983890</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Please check back for updates. Last updated: <strong>December 2024</strong>.</p>
    </div>



